<main class="ti">
<section class="tiw tih"><div><div class="tie">Tires installed right</div><h1 class="tit">Tire installation service near you</h1><p class="tic">Whether you bought tires from American Tire Stores or elsewhere, our technicians mount, balance, and install them with care. We finish every installation with the checks that help you leave ready for the road.</p><a class="tib" href="#ti-book">Request an appointment →</a></div><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-66.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Technician installing tires on a vehicle"></section>
<section class="tis tia"><div class="tiw tig2"><article class="tip"><div class="tie">When to book</div><h3>When to book tire installation</h3><p>Professional installation makes sure your tires are fitted, balanced, and ready to perform.</p><ul class="til"><li>New tires purchased online or elsewhere</li><li>Tires need mounting and balancing</li><li>Seasonal tire changeover</li><li>Old tires need safe disposal</li></ul></article><article class="tip"><div class="tie">What’s included</div><h3>What’s included in tire installation?</h3><p>Every installation is completed with the details that support a safe and smooth drive.</p><ul class="til"><li>Mount and balance your new tires</li><li>Install tires and wheels correctly</li><li>TPMS reset or sensor service when needed</li><li>Torque wheel hardware to specification</li></ul></article></div></section>
<section class="tis tid"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">Good to know</div><h2 class="tit">Tire installation — how often, how long, and what it costs</h2><p class="tic">Installation is needed whenever new tires are fitted. Timing and cost depend on tire size, wheel condition, sensor service, and your vehicle’s requirements.</p><div class="tig3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tip"><h3>New tires</h3><p>Professional mounting and balancing help your tires start their life correctly.</p></article><article class="tip"><h3>Seasonal changes</h3><p>Swap tire sets with the same careful inspection and torque procedure.</p></article><article class="tip"><h3>TPMS service</h3><p>We inspect compatible sensors and reset the system as needed.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="tis"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">How booking works</div><h2 class="tit">From request to back on the road</h2><div class="tig4" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tip tist"><b>1</b><h3>Request online</h3><p>Choose your preferred store.</p></article><article class="tip tist"><b>2</b><h3>Check in</h3><p>Tell us about your tires and vehicle.</p></article><article class="tip tist"><b>3</b><h3>Inspect & install</h3><p>We mount, balance, and complete final checks.</p></article><article class="tip tist"><b>4</b><h3>Back on the road</h3><p>Leave with your tires ready to perform.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="tis tia"><div class="tiw tisplit"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-66.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Professional tire installation"><div><div class="tie">Why it matters</div><h2 class="tit">Why tire installation matters</h2><p class="tic">Tires are your vehicle’s connection to the road. Proper installation helps preserve handling, even tire wear, and a comfortable drive from the first mile.</p><ul class="til"><li>Helps maintain safe handling and traction</li><li>Supports even tire wear</li><li>Balances tires for a smoother ride</li><li>Confirms wheel hardware is tightened correctly</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="tis"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">The details matter</div><h2 class="tit">What proper installation actually includes</h2><p class="tic">The right process goes beyond putting a tire on a wheel. Our technicians complete the checks needed for dependable on-road performance.</p><div class="tig4" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tip"><h3>Mounting</h3><p>Careful fitting for your tires and wheels.</p></article><article class="tip"><h3>Balancing</h3><p>Helps reduce vibration and promote smooth driving.</p></article><article class="tip"><h3>Torque check</h3><p>Wheel hardware tightened to the correct specification.</p></article><article class="tip"><h3>TPMS check</h3><p>Compatible sensors inspected and reset as needed.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="tis tid"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">Brands we install</div><h2 class="tit">The tire brands we install</h2><p class="tic">We install tires purchased through American Tire Stores and tires you bring to us. Book with your store to confirm service availability for your vehicle.</p><div class="tig3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tip"><h3>Passenger & SUV tires</h3><p>Everyday, all-season, touring, and performance tire installation.</p></article><article class="tip"><h3>Truck & off-road tires</h3><p>Installation for the tires that match your work and weekend needs.</p></article><article class="tip"><h3>Wheel & tire packages</h3><p>Fitting, balancing, and finishing checks for a complete package.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="tis tia"><div class="tiw tisplit"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-67.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Customer discussing tire service options"><div><div class="tie">Straightforward options</div><h2 class="tit">What does tire installation cost?</h2><p class="tic">Pricing depends on tire and wheel size, balancing requirements, and whether TPMS service is needed. Choose a store to request an appointment and confirm the details for your vehicle.</p><a class="tib" href="/pages/financing">Explore financing →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="tis tid" id="ti-book"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">Request an appointment</div><h2 class="tit">Book tire installation at your store</h2><p class="tic">Choose your nearest American Tire Stores location to start your tire installation request.</p><div class="tibook"><div class="tibrow"><select id="ti-store" aria-label="Choose a store"><option value="">Choose your store</option><option value="52820">Ventura</option><option value="52819">Thousand Oaks</option><option value="52819">Valencia</option><option value="61758">Hollywood</option><option value="52816">Glendale</option><option value="52818">Glendale 2</option><option value="52814">Bellflower</option><option value="52814">Costa Mesa</option><option value="52815">Cathedral City</option></select><button type="button" class="tib" onclick="window.startTireInstallationBooking()">Request tire installation →</button></div><div id="ti-widget" class="tiwidget">Choose a store above to begin your tire installation request.</div></div></div></section>
<section class="tis"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">Why American Tire Stores</div><h2 class="tit">Service Southern California drivers trust</h2><div class="tig3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tip"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The installation was quick, the car drove smoothly, and the team explained the final checks.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="tip"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“They handled my new tires with care and made sure the TPMS light was reset before I left.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="tip"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Easy to book and professional from check-in through installation.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article></div></div></section>
<section class="tis tia"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">Near you</div><h2 class="tit">Tire installation near you, across Southern California</h2><p class="tic">Professional tire installation is available at every American Tire Stores location.</p><div class="locs"><article class="loc"><h3>Ventura</h3><p>5100 Telegraph Rd<br>(805) 644-3330</p><a href="/pages/location-ventura-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Thousand Oaks</h3><p>621 E Thousand Oaks Blvd<br>(805) 379-1910</p><a href="/pages/location-thousand-oaks-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Valencia</h3><p>23510 Valencia Blvd, Unit A<br>(661) 596-1444</p><a href="/pages/location-valencia-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Hollywood</h3><p>1174 N Western Ave<br>(323) 372-9372</p><a href="/pages/location-hollywood-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Glendale</h3><p>737 S Glendale Ave<br>(818) 243-3191</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Glendale 2</h3><p>1130 S Central Ave<br>(818) 547-2010</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ii-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Bellflower</h3><p>9509 Alondra Blvd<br>(562) 804-4737</p><a href="/pages/location-bellflower-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Costa Mesa</h3><p>2049 Harbor Blvd<br>(949) 802-6419</p><a href="/pages/location-costa-mesa-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Cathedral City</h3><p>68406 E Palm Canyon Dr<br>(760) 469-9510</p><a href="/pages/location-cathedral-city-ca">Store details →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="tis"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">More services</div><h2 class="tit">Related auto services</h2><div class="tig3 related" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tip"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-64.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Wheel alignment"><div class="body"><h3>Wheel alignment</h3><p>Help tires wear evenly and your vehicle track straight.</p><a href="/pages/service-wheel-alignment">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="tip"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-68.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="TPMS service"><div class="body"><h3>TPMS service</h3><p>Diagnose and service tire-pressure monitoring concerns.</p><a href="/pages/service-tpms">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="tip"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-65.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Brake service"><div class="body"><h3>Brake service</h3><p>Keep braking performance ready for the road.</p><a href="/pages/service-brake-repair">Learn more →</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="tis tia"><div class="tiw ticn"><div class="tie">Good to know</div><h2 class="tit">Tire installation FAQ</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I bring tires I bought somewhere else?</summary><p>Yes. Contact your selected location to confirm availability and requirements for the tires and wheels you are bringing in.</p></details><details><summary>How long does tire installation take?</summary><p>Timing varies by vehicle, tire size, and service needs. Your store can confirm the expected time when you request an appointment.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need an alignment with new tires?</summary><p>An alignment is recommended when tire wear or handling indicates it may be needed. Our team can inspect and advise.</p></details><details><summary>Do you balance the tires during installation?</summary><p>Yes. Mounting and balancing are part of a professional tire installation service.</p></details><details><summary>Is an appointment required?</summary><p>An appointment is recommended so the store can reserve time and confirm service availability.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="tifinal"><div class="tiw"><div class="tie">Ready for the road</div><h2 class="tit">Ready for tire installation?</h2><p class="tic">Request an appointment at your nearest American Tire Stores location today.</p><a class="tib" href="#ti-book">Request an appointment →</a></div></section>
